[b]CCS 1.0.0-beta.1[/b]

[list]
[*]Boss moves: 85 new moves from six bosses and four enemies, listed first in the move list under [b]Boss:[/b].[/*]
[*]Moves from bigger or smaller bodies are sized to yours, so a Droeg lunge carries you your own distance, not his.[/*]
[*]Combo step Skip keeps working after loading a save, travelling or dying.[/*]
[/list]

